    "title": "What stores are open Easter Sunday? Are Walmart, Trader Joe's open or closed today? Here's a list",
    "text": "Updated April 5, 2026, 7:29 a.m. ETMany stores will remain open for business on Easter Sunday, including major retailers like Walmart and Trader Joe's.Other major retailers such as Target, Costco, and Sam's Club are expected to be closed for the holiday.A number of grocery stores, pharmacies, and home improvement stores will operate on Easter.It is recommended to call your local store to confirm their holiday hours before visiting.Today may be Easter, but that doesn't mean shopping can't happen on Easter Sunday.Some stores may be closed today, but there are plenty still hoping for customers. Is Walmart open on Easter Sunday? Is Trader Joe's closed?Here's what we know about which Easter stores are closed and open:Is Walmart open today on Easter Sunday 2026? Is the store closed on Easter Day?Walmart stores are open on Easter Sunday.Is Trader Joe's open today on Easter Sunday 2026? Is the store closed on Easter Day?Trader Joe's stores are open on Easter Sunday.List of stores open on Easter Sunday 2026: What stores are not closed today?Here's a list of stores expected to be open on Easter Sunday. Each of these stores will be open at most locations on Easter, or are expected to be open based on recent holiday participation. Please call ahead to your local store, as there are always exceptions:Ace HardwareAlbertson'sBarnes & NobleBass Pro ShopsBig LotsBJs Wholesale ClubCabela'sCVSDollar GeneralFresh MarketOrder groceries with InstacartHome DepotIKEAKrogerOld NavyPetcoPetSmartRite AidSafewayStarbucksTrader Joe'sWalmartWalgreensWhole FoodsList of stores closed on Easter Sunday 2026: What stores are not open today?Here's a list of stores expected to be closed on Easter Sunday. Each of these stores will have some location closures for Easter, or are expected to be closed based on recent holiday closures. Please call ahead to your local store, as there are always exceptions:AldiAppleBanana RepublicBath and Body WorksBest BuyBloomingdale'sBob's Discount FurnitureBurlingtonThe Container StoreCostcoCrate + BarrelDick's Sporting GoodFive BelowGapGoodwillH-E-B GroceryThe Honey Baked Ham CompanyHobby LobbyJCPenneyKohl'sHomeGoodsLowe'sMacy'sMarshallsMichael'sNordstromNordstrom RackOffice DepotPublixSam's ClubStaplesSuperCutsTargetT.J. Maxx Save on Easter supplies with Amazon PrimeWhen is Easter 2027? What date is Easter Sunday next year?Easter 2027 will be celebrated on Sunday, March 28, 2027, for most Christians, predominantly Catholics and Protestants.Chris Sims is a trending reporter at Midwest Connect Gannett. Follow him on Twitter: @ChrisFSims.Our editors independently choose our recommendations. Some content is produced with paid support from a third party, however our editorial decisions remain independent. If you buy through our links, the USA TODAY Network may earn a commission. Prices and availability may change.",
